[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3151664751","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109288#issuecomment-3151664751","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109288","id":3151664751,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc672pZv","user":{"login":"knightmb","id":3860711,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NjA3MTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3860711?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/knightmb","html_url":"https://github.com/knightmb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knightmb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knightmb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knightmb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knightmb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knightmb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knightmb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knightmb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knightmb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knightmb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-04T17:13:46Z","updated_at":"2025-08-04T17:15:22Z","body":"This crash is related to processor generation. It seems the SSE4.2 SIMD CPU instruction is now required after v4.5-dev4. In Windows, you get a warning about this. In Linux, you just get a crash, that is why I didn't understand what the issue was at the time. I don't know what changed that makes SSE4.2 now required, I'll save that for more research.\n\nSuccessful test on this system:\n**Godot v4.5.beta4 - Mageia 8 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GT 1030 (nvidia) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-2400 CPU @ 3.10GHz (4 threads)**\n\nWhat happens on older processor generations (Windows 10), for future reference should others 